title: Authorizations › Case page › Numbers and notes
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042
intro: The strip of three figures under the header card. It stays on screen on all three tabs and changes as actions are applied. What used to be sentences under each figure is in an info icon beside its label.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the numbers are seed data plus simple arithmetic.
---
screen pg "Under the header card\none card, three figures"

group gT1 "Approval chance"
  screen t1 "'Approval chance' (or 'Chance to overturn' on a denial)\nRing counts up over about a second\n'62% → 88%'"
  process t1b "Pill 'Moderate · 57–66%' and a short caption\n'with every action', 'up to 88% with the rest' or 'now'\nStrong 80+, Moderate 55–79, At risk below 55"
  click ni "Hover or focus the info icon 'About the approval chance'"
  overlay n2 "'Decision support for documentation and workflow only. It does not recommend or decide care, never blocks a request and is never shown to payers or patients.'"
endgroup

group gT2 "How sure are we"
  screen t2 "'How sure are we'\nHigh, Medium or Benchmark estimate\n'1,248 similar cases'"
  click si "Hover or focus 'About the similar cases'"
  decision dBm "Fewer than 100 similar cases from you and the network?"
  overlay t2a "'212 yours, 806 from the network, 230 benchmark.'"
  overlay t2b "'Little history for this payer and level of care: 210 of 238 are benchmark cases.'"
endgroup

group gT3 "Days likely granted"
  screen t3 "'Days likely granted' 11 of 14 days\nIOP counts units"
  click di "Hover or focus 'About the days likely granted'"
  overlay t3a "'62% chance of all 14, otherwise most likely 7.'"
  process t3b "On a denial: 'Days in question' 7 of 14 days, no info icon"
endgroup

click esc "Esc or move away"
goto gT "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Tabs and deep links"
store ap "Applying actions moves the ring, the range and the days\nAdding clinical context moves them by a point each (up to three)\nRefining the recommendations moves the number after the arrow"

pg --> t1 --> t1b
t1 --> ni --> n2 --> esc
pg --> t2 --> si --> dBm
dBm -->|No| t2a --> esc
dBm -->|Yes| t2b --> esc
pg --> t3 --> di --> t3a --> esc
t3 -.-> t3b
pg --> gT
t1b -.-> ap
